 "description": "Current weather and hourly/daily forecast for any place name or lat,lon: temperature, feels-like, wind, gusts, rain, cloud, humidity, UV \u2014 up to 9 days. Forecast from the Norwegian Meteorological Institute (MET Norway), the same model data yr.no uses, worldwide. Place names are geocoded with OpenStreetMap. Times are UTC plus local time when tz is given (IANA, e.g. Australia/Sydney). Price: $0.001 per call (10 free/day; after that a payment-required result lists x402 options). Errors: returns isError with a message for invalid input or an upstream failure (not charged).",
